OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain dying
OL,6,Fout and cloud breaking with the chance
OL,7,Fof some evening sun towards the Angus
OL,8,Fcoast. Clear spells overnight, a few
OL,9,Fshowers perhaps reaching the west,
OL,10,Fwindy at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBright and breezy with
OL,13,Foccasional showers in the morning,
OL,14,Fespecially for Perthshire, mostly dry
OL,15,Ftowards Dundee and St Andrews. Fresh
OL,16,Fwinds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
