OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Sunday and less
OL,7,Fwindy than previous days, unsettled on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday with some rain but
OL,9,Falso some brighter weather.
